
# DFD Kasus B - Sistem Berbagi Dokumen melalui Tautan Sementara

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph PUBLIC["TRUST BOUNDARY 1 - PUBLIK"]
        OWNER["Browser Pemilik Dokumen"]
        RECIPIENT["Browser Penerima Eksternal - Tanpa Login"]
        ADMIN["Browser Admin Organisasi"]
    end

    subgraph BACKEND["TRUST BOUNDARY 2 - APLIKASI"]
        APP["P1 - Backend Dokumen"]
    end

    subgraph STORAGE["TRUST BOUNDARY 3 - PENYIMPANAN"]
        DB[("D1 - Database Metadata")]
        OS[("D2 - Object Storage")]
    end

    OWNER -->|"1. Upload file dan identitas pemilik"| APP
    APP -->|"2. Status upload"| OWNER

    APP -->|"3. Simpan isi file"| OS
    APP -->|"4. Simpan metadata file"| DB

    OWNER -->|"5. Buat atau cabut tautan"| APP
    APP -->|"6. Simpan identitas tautan, masa berlaku 24 jam, status pencabutan dan log"| DB
    APP -->|"7. Tautan berbagi atau status pencabutan"| OWNER

    RECIPIENT -->|"8. Token tautan dan permintaan akses tanpa login"| APP
    APP -->|"9. Periksa tautan dan status"| DB
    DB -->|"10. Metadata, masa berlaku dan status pencabutan"| APP

    APP -->|"11. Permintaan file setelah validasi"| OS
    OS -->|"12. Isi file"| APP
    APP -->|"13. File untuk diunduh atau akses ditolak"| RECIPIENT

    APP -->|"14. Catat aktivitas penggunaan tautan"| DB

    ADMIN -->|"15. Permintaan metadata dan audit log"| APP
    DB -->|"16. Data metadata dan audit log"| APP
    APP -->|"17. Metadata dan audit log tanpa isi file"| ADMIN

    style PUBLIC fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00,stroke-width:2px
    style BACKEND fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px
    style STORAGE fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px

    style OWNER fill:#ffe0b2,stroke:#ef6c00
    style RECIPIENT fill:#ffe0b2,stroke:#ef6c00
    style ADMIN fill:#ffe0b2,stroke:#ef6c00
    style APP fill:#bbdefb,stroke:#1565c0
    style DB fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style OS fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
```
